"hero": "\n<section\n        class=\"page-hero service-hero\"\n        style=\"--service-image: url(&quot;plumbing-leak-perth.png&quot;)\"\n      >\n        <div class=\"shell\">\n          {{ppp:breadcrumbs}}\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">Plumbing repair service</span>\n          <h1>Water Leak Detection Perth</h1><aside class=\"intent-safety\" data-intent-safety><p><strong>Is the concern at the water meter?</strong> Use <a href=\"https://www.watercorporation.com.au/help-and-advice/water-issues/leaks/leaking-meter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Water Corporation guidance for a leaking meter</a> rather than assuming every leak is private pipework. Do not approach water near electrical equipment.</p></aside>\n<p>Arrange water leak detection and plumbing repair in Perth with Ellis Services Group. We investigate suspected hidden leaks, visible pipe leaks and leaking connections, then explain the access and repair work required. Our local team provides a property-specific repair plan and written quote rather than treating every damp patch as the same fault.</p>\n          <a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:0413477667\">Call 0413 477 667</a> <a class=\"button service-book-button\" href=\"contact.html?service=water-leak-detection-perth.html\">Book water leak detection and repair</a>\n        </div>\n      </section>" as TrustedHtml,
