"id": "service-quote",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section service-quote\" id=\"service-quote\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Water leak detection and repair costs in Perth</h2><div class=\"price-guide\" aria-labelledby=\"ellis-price-guide\">\n            <div class=\"shell\">\n              <div class=\"price-guide__intro\">\n                <p class=\"price-guide__kicker\">Ellis Price Guide</p>\n                <h2 id=\"ellis-price-guide\">Water leak detection price guide</h2>\n                <p>\n                  A practical guide for a standard leak-detection repair at a\n                  Perth property.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"price-guide__grid\">\n                <article class=\"price-guide__item\">\n                  <h3>Water leak detection</h3>\n                  <p class=\"price-guide__range\">AUD $275–$550</p>\n                  <p class=\"price-guide__unit\">per repair · incl. GST</p>\n                </article>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"price-guide__notice\">\n                <strong>Guide conditions:</strong> These AUD ranges are for\n                standard-hours, standard-scope work and are incl. GST. Access,\n                materials, extra pipe, cable or circuit work, compliance work,\n                emergency or after-hours work and unforeseen repairs are\n                confirmed in a written quote before work proceeds.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div><h3>What your written quote covers</h3><p>The position of the suspected leak, the available access and whether the affected pipe or connection is exposed determine the investigation and repair scope. We distinguish the work needed to locate the source from the repair and any access or reinstatement work included in the written quote.</p><p>The final written quote sets out the work included, materials and any agreed additional tasks. We explain changes to the scope before extra work proceeds. <a href=\"contact.html?service=water-leak-detection-perth.html\">Request a water leak detection and repair quote</a>.</p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "service-faq",
"kind": "faq",
"container": "\n<section class=\"section faq service-editorial-faq\" id=\"service-faq\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Water Leak Detection Perth FAQs</h2><!-- site-intent:start --><div class=\"intent-content\" data-site-intent><h3>Finding the source before choosing the repair</h3><p>A concealed leak, a leaking tap and water entering from another building element can look similar from the surface. Tell us when the damp area changes and which nearby fixtures are used. Detection, opening-up, plumbing repair and restoring finishes are separate decisions in the written scope.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"tap-mixer-repairs-perth.html\">Leaks at taps and mixers</a></li><li><a href=\"burst-pipe-repair-perth.html\">Repairing a known damaged pipe</a></li><li><a href=\"shower-plumbing-repairs-perth.html\">Shower Plumbing Leak Repairs Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"water-pressure-perth.html\">Low Water Pressure &amp; Water Hammer Perth</a></li></ul><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:0:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:0:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:1:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:1:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:2:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:2:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:3:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:3:answer}}</details></div><!-- site-intent:end --><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:4:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:4:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:5:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:5:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:6:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:6:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:7:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:7:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:8:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:8:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:9:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:9:answer}}</details></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
"items": [
{
"question": "Can you guarantee finding a hidden leak without opening a wall?",
"answer": "<p>Access and the suspected source determine what investigation is appropriate. Do not assume that every leak can be located or repaired without opening finishes. The proposed method and any access or restoration work need to be explained before approval.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Does a high water bill prove there is a leaking pipe?",
"answer": "<p>No. It is useful context, not a diagnosis. Include any observed water, changes in use and available records. If the concern is at the water meter or supply network, use Water Corporation guidance rather than assuming it is private pipework.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Can a hidden water leak cause a high bill without visible water damage?",
"answer": "<p>Yes, a concealed leak is possible without visible damage. A bill increase alone is insufficient to diagnose one. <a href=\"#learn-about-water-leak-detection-perth\">Read the explanation.</a></p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Why is my water meter moving when no water is being used?",
"answer": "<p>Flow without expected use can indicate a leak or a fixture still drawing water. It cannot locate the source. <a href=\"#learn-about-water-leak-detection-perth\">Read the explanation.</a></p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Do I need to diagnose the problem first?",
"answer": "<p>No. Describe the observable change and property context. We inspect the affected area on site to establish the cause and confirm the repair scope. If more access is needed, we agree it with you first.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Can I send photos?",
"answer": "<p>Photos are optional: email safely taken photos to maxinemaintenance.au@outlook.com. You can contact us without photos. Do not approach a hazard, remove covers or dismantle equipment to take a photo.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Can you help with a hidden water leak?",
"answer": "<p>Yes. Describe the property area, any visible moisture and changes you have noticed. This helps us understand the request before work is arranged.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "What should I include in a leak enquiry?",
"answer": "<p>Include the address, affected room or outdoor area, when the issue began, whether water is active and any safe photos.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "What if water is near electrical equipment?",
"answer": "<p>Keep clear of the area and do not touch wet electrical equipment. If there is immediate danger, move to safety and call 000.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Are locating the leak and repairing it the same job?",
"answer": "<p>They can be separate parts of the scope. We explain the investigation, access and proposed repair before work proceeds, and identify any additional access or reinstatement work in the written quote.</p>" as TrustedHtml
}
]
},
{
"id": "service-booking",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section contact-band service-booking\" id=\"service-booking\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Book water leak detection and repair in Perth</h2><p>Include the suburb, where the water appears, when it happens and which fixtures are nearby. Previous repairs and available access information help us plan the visit; you do not need to remove finishes before contacting us. Our local team covers <a href=\"service-areas.html\">all six Perth service regions</a> from our office at 140 St Georges Terrace, Perth WA 6000.</p><p>Call to discuss the work or send the property details through our enquiry form. You do not need to diagnose the fault or complete a technical inspection before contacting us.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:0413477667\">Call 0413 477 667</a> <a class=\"button service-book-button\" href=\"contact.html?service=water-leak-detection-perth.html\">Request a visit &amp; written quote</a></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
